                    <chunk name="param_output" index="0">
                      <items count="6">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Wind Reduction Factors

Dimensionless wind velocity of each sensor point from the nearest simulated wind direction with the corresponding velocity and wind direction from the weather data for every hour of the year.
This yields a datatree with wind reduction factors of the size [8760 h x number of sensor points].</item>
                        <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">300cf753-8617-4582-b4eb-1469f9e33a05</item>
                        <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Wind Reduction Factors</item>
                        <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">WF</item>
                        <item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
